WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.200
Give your agents a way to use your Mac.

00:02.530 --> 00:07.300
Action connects your agent to native apps and the browser,
using the permissions you allow.

00:07.710 --> 00:08.800
Watch it work.

00:08.990 --> 00:12.950
Record the screen, and keep screenshots
and a log of its actions.

00:13.330 --> 00:17.350
Review what happened, then replay the run
or share the recording.

00:18.610 --> 00:20.360
Action. Part of Lattices.
